--!strict
-- The UI's pixel icons (docs/DESIGN.md "UI style"): 16×16 sprites painted from character grids, in the same
-- chunky WorldBox pixel style as the map, so icons look the same on every phone and PC (emoji don't).
-- Pure Luau on buffers (no Roblox APIs): tested under Lune. Pixels are RGBA bytes, ready for
-- EditableImage:WritePixelsBuffer. src/client/UI/Icons.luau puts them on screen.
--
-- Colour codes: K outline, W white, w light grey, g grey, d dark grey, e soot, Y gold, y pale gold, O deep gold,
-- o bronze, R red, r dark red, B blue, b dark blue, c pale cyan, G green, n dark green, P purple, p dark purple,
-- T skin, t wood, S parchment, s parchment shade, F fire orange, "." transparent.

